      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "真正该先问的是：这个业务问题，到底需不需要 Agent？",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 7,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 6.158,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s02.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 5.808,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s02.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "如果流程很清楚，规则也稳定，你需要的可能只是自动化，或者一个 Workflow。",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 8,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 8.75,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s03.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 8.4,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s03.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "Agent 真正适合的是路径不固定，需要调用工具，需要根据反馈调整，还要持续推进目标。",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 8,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 9.998,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s04.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 9.648,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s04.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "比如审批、合规检查、内容从草稿到审核再发布。这适合顺序工作流。",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 8,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 9.062,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s05.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 8.712,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s05.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "比如客户问题排查、市场研究、代码库理解、数据分析。这时可以用 Single Agent。",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 10,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 8.966,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s06.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 8.616,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s06.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "比如贷款风险评估，要同时看信用、市场、运营、合规。这时 Multi-Agent 才有意义。",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 11,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 9.662,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s07.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 9.312,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s07.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "但 Multi-Agent 不是默认选项。它的代价也很真实：成本更高、延迟更长、调试更难。",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 9,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 9.758,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s08.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 9.408,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s08.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "text": "当 Agent 要碰 CRM、订单、支付、审批、内部数据库，重点不再是 Agent 本身，而是 Harness。",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 10,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.614,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s09.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.264,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s09.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "你需要权限控制、日志记录、监控、评估、回滚、人工接管。",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 7,
      "actualDurationSeconds": 8.75,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s10.mp3",
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 8.4,
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents/audio/s10.mp3",
